Hrnec\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              <div class=\"word-card-body\">\n                <h2>la pentola</h2>\n                <div class=\"word-examples\">\n                  <strong>3 příkladové věty</strong>\n                  <ol>\n                    <li>\n                      <span lang=\"it\">La zuppa cuoce nella pentola.</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      <span lang=\"it\">Riempio la pentola d’acqua.</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      <span lang=\"it\">La pentola è sul fornello.</span>\n                    </li>\n                  </ol>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"la pentola\" type=\"button\">🔊 Poslouchejte</button>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"word-card\">\n              <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/padella.webp\" alt=\"Pánev na smažení\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              <div class=\"word-card-body\">\n                <h2>la padella</h2>\n                <div class=\"word-examples\">\n                  <strong>3 příkladové věty</strong>\n                  <ol>\n                    <li>\n                      <span lang=\"it\">Cucino le verdure in padella.</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      <span lang=\"it\">Scaldo un po’ d’olio nella padella.</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      <span lang=\"it\">La padella è ancora calda.</span>\n                    </li>\n                  </ol>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"la padella\" type=\"button\">🔊 Poslouchejte</button>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"word-card\">\n              <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/piatto.webp\" alt=\"Talíř\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            